<h3>2026-09-07 — HelpDesk: Grok Bot ticket-change webhook notify</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> HelpDesk now POSTs a small JSON event to an admin-configurable Grok Bot webhook (routine <code>helpdesk-ticket-change-webhook</code>) on ticket create, reply/note, status/priority/assign changes, and mail→ticket ingest notify. Failures are logged and swallowed so UI actions never block. Config via <code>/HelpDesk/admin/settings</code> (<code>site_config</code> keys) or <code>HELPDESK_WEBHOOK_URL</code> / <code>HELPDESK_WEBHOOK_AUTH</code> env.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Replaces the workstation cron HTML scrape bridge so the HelpDesk support bot wakes only on real ticket changes (CSC-20260907-9636).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Util/HelpDeskWebhook.pm</code> (new), <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Controller/HelpDesk.pm</code>, <code>Comserv/root/CSC/HelpDesk/admin_settings.tt</code> (new), <code>Comserv/root/CSC/HelpDesk/ticket_view.tt</code>, AI create paths, <code>Comserv/script/test_helpdesk_webhook.pl</code>.</p>
